The zerocopy notifier cleanup and the `zcopy` flag were set only inside the `if (rm->m_rs)` block. When a zerocopy send fails before the message is queued (so `rm->m_rs` is NULL but `op_mmp_znotifier` is set), the notifier is never processed and the page freeing loop uses `__free_page` instead of `put_page`, causing a double-free and a notifier leak.

