} else if (znotifier) {
    mm_unaccount_pinned_pages(&znotifier->z_mmp);
    kfree(rds_info_from_znotifier(znotifier));
}
Reason:
The fix captures the zerocopy notifier unconditionally before checking `m_rs`, ensuring the notifier and associated page accounting are handled regardless of whether the message has been queued. If `m_rs` is NULL but `znotifier` exists, the pinned pages are properly unaccounted and the notifier is freed, preventing the resource leak and incorrect page freeing.

